      "text": "Per audit (average of 25 recorded fixture audits)\ngrade 5.0 (listing + up to 4 competitors) · promise vs proof 2.0 · read images 1 · coverage 1 · briefs 1 · faithfulness 0.6\n= about 10.6 model requests, 32k input + 8.5k output tokens",
